{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SYNOPSIS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742150/extras/cc0ab3086921f9ef767ddc42b2a7ddbf.avif?t=1757304616\" width=600 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Balance work, vampirism, and socialising as you explore Kings Cross during the last year of the millennium. Keep a lid on your darkest desires and be rewarded with a deeper understanding of what it means to live again. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Or don\u2019t \u2014 no one will stop you. You\u2019re a vampire, after all. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742150/extras/417fcf51a3404cb971958f5c50fcb2dd.avif?t=1757304616\" width=600 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Meet a cast of intriguing individuals all running from secrets of their own as you try to run from yours. The past will catch up eventually but what that means, you decide. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Experience heartbreak and betrayal \u2014 and maybe love, if you try hard enough \u2014 as you work the night shift at the local hospital. After all, who wants to spend New Year's alone?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742150/extras/8bad63cc55819992f437a47152dd299d.avif?t=1757304616\" width=600 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Find new ways to satiate your hunger that won't lead to a forced resignation \u2014 or a stake through the heart. As you come across a variety of blood bags, not all of them will be so forgiving. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Will you blend into the backdrop of humanity or push against the fold? It's up to you to choose what kind of person you want to be \u2014 or if you want to be a humane at all. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five characters of various origins to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings per character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylised 1-bit pixel art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Migratory loss and community building... but make it Supernatural(TM)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One secret route</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >... and in-game collectables!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742150/extras/37e6964a240d44d928be557d0e152c6e.avif?t=1757304616\" width=600 height=126 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3742150?t=1757304616","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742150/dcbbcc195e8cc4198f9e1e2fe96dd0521bce2f27/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757304616","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742150/16ff0546e555b28a43d0555adf8d32f6f2b01f03/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757304616","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742150/16ff0546e555b28a43d0555adf8d32f6f2b01f03/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757304616","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Narrated Game Menus","id":71},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains mature language, and has mentions and references to death and alcohol. Viewer discretion is advised."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SYNOPSIS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742150/extras/cc0ab3086921f9ef767ddc42b2a7ddbf.avif?t=1757304616\" width=600 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Balance work, vampirism, and socialising as you explore Kings Cross during the last year of the millennium. Keep a lid on your darkest desires and be rewarded with a deeper understanding of what it means to live again. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Or don\u2019t \u2014 no one will stop you. You\u2019re a vampire, after all. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742150/extras/417fcf51a3404cb971958f5c50fcb2dd.avif?t=1757304616\" width=600 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Meet a cast of intriguing individuals all running from secrets of their own as you try to run from yours. The past will catch up eventually but what that means, you decide. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Experience heartbreak and betrayal \u2014 and maybe love, if you try hard enough \u2014 as you work the night shift at the local hospital. After all, who wants to spend New Year's alone?</p><p class